# Defense-in-depth for the "confused deputy" gap documented in
# docs/security.md: SpecFence pins its scope MANIFEST to the base ref, but
# the CI/workflow definitions and the Action's own code are still PR-head-
# controlled. No amount of correct manifest-pinning protects against a PR
# that edits the enforcement itself - that has to be caught by human review.
# Require a maintainer review on anything that could weaken enforcement.

/.github/workflows/    @neshboy
/.specfence/           @neshboy
/packages/action/      @neshboy
/CODEOWNERS            @neshboy
